belluikit/webgpu
https://github.com/belluikit/webgpu

This product is a modified version of oliverbestmann/webgpu
(https://github.com/oliverbestmann/webgpu), which continues
cogentcore/webgpu (https://github.com/cogentcore/webgpu), itself derived
from rajveermalviya/go-webgpu (https://github.com/rajveermalviya/go-webgpu).
It is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

